WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.627
In the CASE pivot each output measure has a
different condition The

00:00:05.641 --> 00:00:11.238
GROUP BY defines one output row per month Inside
that month each

00:00:11.265 --> 00:00:17.314
SUM looks only at rows belonging to its diagnosis
category This separation

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:20.853
between row grain and category condition is the core
pivot pattern
